  {
   "id": "bonfire-peaks-129028@1.1.1",
   "gameId": "bonfire-peaks-129028",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2022-07-08T22:51:07.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey folks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I've just pushed a new patch of bug fixes. Nothing too glamorous, just more stability. :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also ICYMI - the first chapter of \"Lost Memories\" DLC is coming soon, wishlist here!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "v1.1.1 Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fixed many situations where moves were incorrectly disallowed / allowed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a handful of frame-specific undo/reset bugs",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a few bugs where crates joined by arrows could disconnect",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a few bugs where crumble blocks didn't crumble when they should",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a few bugs where crates didn't get impaled on spikes when they should",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a few bugs where crates could intersect",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a few bugs where arrows snapped when they shouldn't and vice versa",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved logic around when crates get pushed by a rotation vs when they get carried",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bunch of bugs where crates that are carried by a rotation could do spooky things",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a softlock (seen in \"Bodyguard\")",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Disallow queueing of repeated \"grab\" action",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed 2x2x1 shape with joined arrows could float",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed crate incorrectly falling when a crate it's joined to is supported by a crumble block: Fixed bugs where, under very specific circumstances, ...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Player could walk through crates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Flying crate doesn't fire when it should (seen in \"Bodyguard\")",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Climbing into a stack of crates pushes them too far",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Wall spikes push crates by 2 tiles rather than 1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Crate on head while climbing causes ghost pushing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Movement incorrectly allowed while an arrow was mid-air (seen in \"Turning The Corner\")",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
